            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Compassionate care is a concept which is conveyed through a pro-active approach to ensuring the wellbeing of hospitalised children. It must be inscribed in the hospital's charter. In a paediatric follow-up care and rehabilitation unit, it is implemented in the daily practice of the multi-disciplinary team.</AbstractText>
